2:["$","p",null,{"children":"Every Hercules plan â€” including the free tier â€” gives you access to the SuperJ verified consumer panel, AI-powered survey creation, and WhatsApp-native delivery. Respondents are identity-verified using Zero Knowledge Proof (ZKP), ensuring every response comes from a real, authenticated person with zero bots and zero fraud."}]
3:["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-gray-900 text-xl font-semibold mb-3","children":"Free Plan â€” Start Researching at â‚¹0"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The Hercules free plan is permanent â€” no credit card required, no trial expiry. It includes 10 survey chats per month, access to 300 verified SuperJ respondents, and 3 active research campaigns. It is designed for early-stage startups and founders who need to validate ideas before committing to a paid plan."}]]}]
4:["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-gray-900 text-xl font-semibold mb-3","children":"Starter Plan â€” â‚¹1,119/month"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The Starter plan unlocks unlimited AI access, the full 20M+ verified SuperJ consumer panel across 50+ Indian cities, and Poseidon advanced analytics. It is the best choice for growing startups, D2C brands, and SMBs running regular consumer research. At â‚¹1,119/month, it is a fraction of the cost of a single traditional research study."}]]}]
5:["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-gray-900 text-xl font-semibold mb-3","children":"Pro Plan â€” â‚¹30,000/quarter"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The Pro plan includes everything in Starter plus priority support, a dedicated account manager, and custom research campaign design. It is built for enterprises, BFSI companies, FMCG brands, and government bodies that need high-volume, high-fidelity consumer research at scale. Trusted by ICICI Prudential, SBI Mutual Fund, Unilever, and the Government of Karnataka."}]]}]
6:["$","section",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-gray-900 text-xl font-semibold mb-3","children":"How Hercules Compares to Nielsen, Kantar, and SurveyMonkey"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"A single consumer research study with Nielsen or Kantar typically costs â‚¹5â€“50 lakhs and takes 4â€“8 weeks to deliver. SurveyMonkey charges per response but provides no respondent verification, meaning results are frequently polluted by bots and click-farms. Hercules delivers ZKP-verified insights from 20M+ real Indian consumers in hours, not weeks, at â‚¹1,119/month â€” making it 10-100x more cost-effective than any traditional alternative."}]]}]
